#NEXUS

[ morschhauser2018a_fig4: Panel A only, read by eye; vertical, root at the bottom; fully resolved. Panels B-F are five more trees of overlapping taxa (the vertical census stratum takes the figure, the gold takes its first panel). 10 tips, fully resolved. Sample 9 case (census 3, seed 20261272). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=10;
    TAXLABELS
        Psittacosaurus
        Chaoyangsaurus
        Liaoceratops
        Archaeoceratops
        Triceratops
        Centrosaurus
        Montanoceratops
        Leptoceratops
        Bagaceratops
        Protoceratops
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE morschhauser2018a_fig4 = [&R] (Psittacosaurus,(Chaoyangsaurus,(Liaoceratops,(Archaeoceratops,(((Triceratops,Centrosaurus),(Montanoceratops,Leptoceratops)),(Bagaceratops,Protoceratops))))));
END;
